<title>JAPAN: NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP 10-KM CROSS-COUNTRY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-WORLD CUP 10-KM CROSS-COUNTRY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAKUBA, Japan 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of FIS World Cup</p>
<p>Nordic skiing 10-km classical cross-country race on Saturday:</p>
<p>MEN:</p>
<p>1. Silvio Fauner (Italy) 28 minutes 20.2 seconds</p>
<p>2. Erling Jevne (Norway) 28:34.1</p>
<p>3. Jari Isometsa (Finland) 28:37.7</p>
<p>4. Giorgio Di Centa (Italy) 28:47.6</p>
<p>5. Fulvio Valbusa (Italy) 28:48.0</p>
<p>6. Bjorn Dahlie (Norway) 28:48.9</p>
<p>7. Kristen Skjeldal (Norway) 28:54.0</p>
<p>8. Sture Sivertsen (Norway) 29:06.6</p>
<p>9. Marco Albarello (Italy) 29:13.8</p>
<p>10. Jochen Behle (Germany) 29:26.9</p>
<p>WOMEN:</p>
<p>1. Stefania Belmondo (Italy) 16 minutes 36.6 seconds</p>
<p>2. Katerina Neumannova (Czech Republic) 16:48.0</p>
<p>3. Elena Vaelbe (Russia) 16:48.1</p>
